      "argus_panel_via_normal_router": "ARGUS IMPORT\nDrop an XL4ADW workbook or ARGUS dump package here\nBasis reads ARGUS's Input Assumptions Report and builds the whole model from it: no AI, no other input. If the file also has ARGUS's Cash Flow, Basis runs the model and checks it against ARGUS line by line, with the DCF value, before you open it.\nARGUS EXPORT\n\nFill an ARGUS XL4ADW input workbook with this model, then load it into ARGUS with Send Data to AE. Values are written in ARGUS's own formats, and the workbook keeps its dropdowns and AE Reference Sheet.\n\nDrop an XL4ADW input workbook, or click to choose\nFrom any property: in Excel, ARGUS AE \u2192 Create Input Sheets \u2192 Select All \u2192 Fill sheets with AE Data, then save. Basis uses it for the layout only; nothing from that property is copied into this one.",
